<h1>Build a full-featured PBX with VoiceML.</h1>
<p class="lede">Widgets.com is a fictional company with four extensions, a main menu, a ring-all line for the labor force, an AI agent on 0, and voicemail with transcripts. The whole phone system runs on two documents published on voiceml.org and the VoiceML Dashboard, with no application server.</p>
<p class="hero-actions">
	<a class="btn btn-primary" href="/signup/">Free trial</a>
	<a class="btn btn-secondary" href="/voiceml/dashboard/">VoiceML Dashboard</a>
</p>

